FEED JestFan takes the oath as a dwarf knight (down from the hill mines; sees in the dark). Stout, shielded. Hard to kill, slow to finish a fight.
FEED MossyMage takes the oath as an elf mage (out of the old woods past the fields; sees in the dark). Hits hardest. Dies hardest.
FEED DawnCleric takes the oath as a human cleric (valley-born, like most of Bellmire). Keeps the party upright longer than it deserves.
FEED BigAxe takes the oath as an orc barbarian (came over the west road and stayed; sees in the dark). The most meat. Swings heavy, guards nothing.
FEED BigAxe, JestFan descend below, and the bell above does not ring for them yet.
FEED They carry 8 flasks of oil between them.
L28C_EMITTERS floor 5 barracks: 3 (cap 12), creatures 2; lights 51 (shadowed 2)
L28D_DECALS floor 5 barracks: 18 (cap 24)
FEED Floor 5 - a buried town, remade as a barrack room: 1 drowned skeleton warrior, 2 hollowed bone sentinels, 1 skeleton warrior, 1 bone bowman.
FEED The passage narrows until it has to be a mistake, then opens.
FEED The Grubmother, Swarming rises. The brood arrives first and she arrives last, unhurt, behind all of it.
FEED The guild has put down The Grubmother before. Not this one.
FEED The floor is wet, and getting wetter.
